{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["葡萄園之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我要為我所愛的歌唱，唱一首有關他葡萄園的歌：",{"text":"我所愛的在肥沃的山岡上有一個葡萄園。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他鬆土，清除石頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種了上好的葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在園中建了一座瞭望塔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鑿了榨酒池。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他期望收穫好葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得到的卻是壞葡萄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"他說，「耶路撒冷和猶大的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"請你們在我和我的葡萄園之間裁決。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不遺餘力地料理葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希望得到好葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼得到的只是壞葡萄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「現在，我告訴你們我會怎樣處理這葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要除去籬笆，任它被毀壞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拆毀圍牆，任它被踐踏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不再修剪，不再鋤地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任由它荒廢，長滿荊棘和蒺藜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必禁止雲朵降下雨水。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華的葡萄園就是以色列家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂所喜愛的葡萄樹就是猶大人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂希望看到公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻只看見殺戮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望看到公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，卻只聽見冤聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的罪惡"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"那些不斷建房置田、佔光土地、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獨居其中的人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我親耳聽到萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「許多房屋必荒廢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豪華的美宅必無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"十畝葡萄園只產一桶酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二百升種子只產二十升糧食。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"那些從清早到深夜貪杯好酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝到酩酊大醉的人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在琴、瑟、鼓、笛聲中飲酒作樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不理會耶和華的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全然漠視祂手中的工作。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以，我的子民必因無知而被擄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的貴族餓得要死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民眾渴得要命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陰間必敞開喉嚨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"張開無邊的大口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的首領、群眾和宴樂之人都落入其中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人受羞辱，遭貶抑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狂妄者眼目低垂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有萬軍之耶和華因祂的公正而受尊崇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至聖的上帝藉公義彰顯自己的聖潔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，羔羊在那裡吃草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如在自己的草場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寄居者在富人的荒場上進食。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"那些用虛假作繩子拽來罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用套繩拉來邪惡的人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「讓上帝快點，快點完成祂的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓我們看看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓以色列的聖者早點實現祂的計劃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓我們知道。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些善惡不分、黑白顛倒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甜苦不辨的人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些自以為聰明、睿智的人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些以豪飲稱霸、善於調酒的人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們收受賄賂，釋放罪人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不為無辜者主持公道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"他們的根必朽爛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的花朵如飛塵飄落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像火焰吞滅禾稭，燒盡乾草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們厭棄萬軍之耶和華的訓誨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視以色列聖者的言語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華向祂的子民發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸手擊打他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山嶺震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們橫屍街頭，猶如糞土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還沒有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罰的手仍沒有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必豎起旗幟召集遠方的國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹哨叫來地極的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他們必飛速而來！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們無人疲倦，無人踉蹌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人打盹，無人睡覺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都腰帶緊束，鞋帶未斷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的利箭上弦，引弓待發；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的馬蹄堅如巖石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"車輪快如旋風。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們吼叫如獅子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吼叫像猛獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們咆哮著捕食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將獵物叼走，無人能救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日，他們必向以色列咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如怒海澎湃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人若觀看大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只見黑暗和艱難，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光明被密雲遮蓋。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}